    "text": "By Industrial Machinery Digest ,\n7 hours ago A common sight in a visit to the Beaverdam Reservoir Park in Ashburn, Va., during the early evening or on a springtime Saturday morning, will be a few rowing boats – or shells – on the water, crewed by several scholastic rowing teams. The 300-acre reservoir has been a popular place for crew teams to practice. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
